2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-22T14:44:30-07:00","id":1539055,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1538996-v-tm-walk-among-us-or-how-5th-edition-makes-vampires-uncool?p=1539043#post1539043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't see why it's weird.<br /> <br /> Spirits are in fucking everything in an animist setting.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not getting at the heart of why it's actually done by the enemy. They're not doing something that obvious, or they end up like old school Sunburst, where no one wants to use the products; they're smearing the feeling of being unclean over it, which has implications that make the imaginations of those that come across it do most of the heavy lifting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-22T18:29:25-07:00","id":1539071,"title":"","content":"I agree with this critique.<br /> <br /> I still loved it. Some stories were better than others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3901-radiofreedeath","name":"RadioFreeDeath","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-22T18:53:03-07:00","id":1539074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1538996-v-tm-walk-among-us-or-how-5th-edition-makes-vampires-uncool?p=1539019#post1539019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think the TLDR version of my response is.<br /> <br /> &quot;This is a game about playing a magical zombie in the Modern Day that has fooled everyone and have their own mafia. If you want to shame someone about how serious it is, perhaps you are not on as firm a ground as you may think, argument wise.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean yeah that's what the video basically says. Sure the setting is dark and brooding but it also has plenty of goofy shit underneath the surface so it's better to embrace it. For added variety if nothing else.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1538996-v-tm-walk-among-us-or-how-5th-edition-makes-vampires-uncool?p=1539041#post1539041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pretty tired of people hitting the &quot;banes in household products and fast food!&quot; button, though. That was 1e; it got retconned out after for putting something akin to the presence of kegare in everything to throw the Garou off the scent instead.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I mean yeah this is a gross oversimplification for cometic effect on the video's part. But this video isn't a meant to be a lore primer, it's basically a Welcome to &quot;WOD, here's what you can expect in a game&quot; both serious and goofy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-22T22:24:36-07:00","id":1539083,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrornX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1538996-v-tm-walk-among-us-or-how-5th-edition-makes-vampires-uncool?p=1539013#post1539013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Honestly the start of this video basically expresses the same sentiment:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0h1U-_JFAS8&amp;t=1s\" data-code=\"0h1U-_JFAS8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/0h1U-_JFAS8/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> A transcript for those who don't to watch through it:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> TlDr: WOD is a dark setting but it also has plently of goofy shi&quot;$t</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a difference between actual interesting and wild stuff vs &quot;mundane&quot; type of stupid<br /> <br /> Hollow Earth, Aliens, vampire Nazis etc. have existed from the start and it's amazing.<br /> <br /> What current stuff does gives me Banality and I am not even a Changeling. They are boring and stupid in a stupid way, if you get what I am saying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9},{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27335-technoma","name":"Technoma","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-22T23:46:50-07:00","id":1539085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Technoma</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1538996-v-tm-walk-among-us-or-how-5th-edition-makes-vampires-uncool?p=1539083#post1539083\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There is a difference between actual interesting and wild stuff vs &quot;mundane&quot; type of stupid<br /> <br /> Hollow Earth, Aliens, vampire Nazis etc. have existed from the start and it's amazing.<br /> <br /> What current stuff does gives me Banality and I am not even a Changeling. They are boring and stupid in a stupid way, if you get what I am saying.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean yes? <br /> <br /> Like the video basically admits that the former type of stupid exsists and there's no shame for a st to incorporate it into a Chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-23T01:57:32-07:00","id":1539087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hermeticus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1538996-v-tm-walk-among-us-or-how-5th-edition-makes-vampires-uncool?p=1539008#post1539008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's interesting. I wonder how the younger generations relate to these characters and V5 in general.</div> </div> </div> </div>Looking at the art and posts from various sights they proactively ignore the author intent in v5 and do cool fun vampire adventures.....Which has been the norm for around 30 years now. So i cant imagine much interest in vtm misery porn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7},{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-23T02:17:20-07:00","id":1539091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1538996-v-tm-walk-among-us-or-how-5th-edition-makes-vampires-uncool#post1538996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In 2018, the Old World of Darkness was revived with Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition</div> </div> </div> </div>No way it's been thirteen years since 20th Anniversary already...<br /> <br /> <img width=\"307\" height=\"426\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YojkIae.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/YojkIae.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/YojkIae.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":7},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2